Shut the completion hook down on `uninstrument()`. The hook is built fresh on
every `instrument()` and nothing cached it, so with
`OTEL_INSTRUMENTATION_GENAI_COMPLETION_HOOK=upload` each instrument/uninstrument
cycle leaked the upload hook's thread pool, and the last cycle before exit
dropped whatever content it had not finished uploading. A hook passed to
`instrument()` is left alone: it belongs to the caller.
